  "zh": "# DeepSeek连续霸榜、055舰开放、间谍罪成死刑、国考准考证、方力申破吉尼斯纪录\n## AI 与科技\n- **DeepSeek连续霸榜全球第一**：说明AI模型竞争已进入全球主流，用户与企业都在密切关注其表现。\n- **DeepSeek限额规则**：限制免费对话显示公司在商业化路上，用户需权衡便利与付费。\n## 产业与安全\n- **055大驱向公众开放**：中国首次公开大型驱逐舰，意味着军事透明度提升，外界关注度激增。\n- **间谍罪死刑**：重刑警示间谍风险，对国家安全政策产生深远影响。\n## 社会民生\n- **27国考准考证**：提前打印准考证方便考生，体现教育考试制度的数字化进步。\n- **方力申破纪录**：8小时跨海破纪录展现个人耐力与训练水平，激励大众追求极限。\n- **小学生纸短剧爆火**：纸质短剧在校园刷屏，说明传统媒体仍有独特吸引力，校园文化新动向。",
  "en": "# DeepSeek tops charts, 055 warship opens, spy sentenced, Gaokao IDs issued, Chinese athlete breaks record.\n## AI & Tech\n- **DeepSeek five-week global chart top**: Shows AI models are dominating worldwide attention and market competition.\n- **DeepSeek usage caps**: Limits free conversation time, signaling a shift toward paid services.\n## Industry & Safety\n- **055 destroyer public opening**: First public display of China's advanced warship, boosting military transparency interest.\n- **Spy death sentence**: Severe penalty underscores crackdown on espionage and national security.\n## Social Life\n- **27 Gaokao exam IDs**: Early ID printing simplifies exam process, reflecting digital reforms.\n- **Fang Lishen sea crossing record**: Eight-hour swim across the strait showcases extreme endurance and inspires the public.\n- **Primary school paper short dramas**: Paper-based short dramas trend on campus, highlighting a revival of traditional media formats."
